    "message": "Apex AdBlocker blocks ads, tracking and malicious sites – always with the same set of lists, with no protection levels to choose from. YouTube Protection works together with the ads list. You can turn protection off for selected sites with the button in the extension popup or on the “Disabled sites” tab."
  },
